<div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
	<p>Use <strong>Sign in</strong> in the Agent's Harness settings to connect your Google account. XpressClaw opens the provider's sign-in flow here and reconnects the Agent when it finishes.</p>
	<p>Host configuration files can reuse a saved login. If the host keeps its Google token in the OS keyring, use Sign in to authorize this Agent.</p>
	<p>For an API key, add <code>GEMINI_API_KEY</code> under Harness environment and set <code>"modelProvider": "gemini"</code> in <code>~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/settings.json</code>. Models and thinking levels appear after the first session connects.</p>
</div>
